# Style Rules & Design System Guidelines

## 1. NAMING CONVENTIONS

### SCSS Variables
- Use kebab-case with descriptive prefixes
- Colors: `$color-primary`, `$color-text-muted`, `$color-gray-100`
- Spacing: `$spacing-xs`, `$spacing-md`, `$spacing-xl`, `$spacing-2xl`
- Shadows: `$shadow-sm`, `$shadow-card`, `$shadow-dropdown`
- Typography: `$font-size-md`, `$font-primary`
- Breakpoints: `$breakpoint-md`, `$breakpoint-lg`

### CSS Custom Properties
- Use `--` prefix with consistent naming
- Follow pattern: `--category-property-state`
- Examples: `--color-bg`, `--color-text-muted`, `--shadow-card-hover`

## 2. COLOR SYSTEM

### Core Colors (Light Theme)
```scss
--color-bg: #ffffff
--color-bg-secondary: #fafafa
--color-text: #171717
--color-text-muted: #71717a
--color-primary: #18181b
--color-primary-hover: #27272a
--color-accent: #525252
--color-accent-hover: #404040
--color-border: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08)
```

### Dark Theme Override Pattern
```scss
[data-theme="dark"] {
  --color-bg: #1a1a1b;
  --color-text: #fafafa;
  --color-border: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
  // Always provide dark variants
}
```

### Semantic Colors
```scss
// Success
--color-success-bg: #f0fdf4 / #0f1419 (dark)
--color-success-text: #16a34a / #4ade80 (dark)
--color-success-border: #bbf7d0 / #166534 (dark)

// Error
--color-error-bg: #fef2f2 / #1c0b0b (dark)
--color-error-text: #dc2626 / #f87171 (dark)

// Warning
--color-warning-bg: #fffbeb / #1a1206 (dark)
--color-warning-text: #ca8a04 / #fbbf24 (dark)
```

## 3. SPACING SYSTEM

### Scale Pattern
```scss
--spacing-xs: 0.25rem    // 4px
--spacing-sm: 0.5rem     // 8px
--spacing-md: 0.75rem    // 12px
--spacing-lg: 1rem       // 16px
--spacing-xl: 1.5rem     // 24px
--spacing-2xl: 2rem      // 32px
--spacing-6xl: 10rem     // 160px (large sections)
```

## 4. SHADOW SYSTEM

### Light Theme Shadows
```scss
--shadow-sm: 0 1px 2px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.03)
--shadow-card: 0 1px 3px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05)
--shadow-card-hover: 0 2px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08)
--shadow-dropdown: 0 4px 12px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1)
--shadow-button-hover: 0 4px 12px rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.4)
```

### Dark Theme Shadows (Stronger)
```scss
--shadow-sm: 0 1px 2px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2)
--shadow-card: 0 1px 3px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3)
--shadow-card-hover: 0 2px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4)
--shadow-dropdown: 0 4px 12px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6)
```

## 5. TRANSITION SYSTEM

### Standard Transitions
```scss
--transition-fast: 0.15s ease
--transition-medium: 0.2s ease
```

### Universal Transition Rule
```scss
*,
*::before,
*::after {
  transition:
    background-color var(--transition-fast),
    color var(--transition-fast),
    border-color var(--transition-fast),
    opacity var(--transition-fast),
    transform var(--transition-fast);
}
```

## 6. BUTTON MIXINS & PATTERNS

### Base Button Mixin
```scss
@mixin button-base {
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  font-family: $font-primary;
  font-weight: 500;
  text-decoration: none;
  white-space: nowrap;
  user-select: none;
  cursor: pointer;
  border-radius: $border-radius-md;
  transition: all var(--transition-fast);

  &:focus {
    outline: 2px solid var(--color-accent);
    outline-offset: 2px;
  }

  &:disabled {
    opacity: 0.5;
    cursor: not-allowed;
  }
}
```

### Button Variants
```scss
// Primary Button
&--primary {
  background: var(--color-primary);
  color: var(--color-bg);
  border: 1px solid var(--color-primary);

  &:hover {
    background: var(--color-primary-hover);
    transform: translateY(-1px);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-button-hover);
  }
}

// Secondary Button
&--secondary {
  background: transparent;
  color: var(--color-primary);
  border: 1px solid var(--color-border);

  &:hover {
    background: var(--color-bg-secondary);
    border-color: var(--color-primary);
  }
}
```

## 7. LINK SYSTEM

### Link Variants
```scss
.link {
  &--subtle { color: #71717a; } // Muted links
  &--accent { color: #6d28d9; } // Purple accent links
  &--external::after { content: "↗"; } // External link indicator
  &--button { /* Button-like styling */ }
  &--ghost { /* Transparent with border */ }
}
```

## 8. COMPONENT PATTERNS

### Card Component
```scss
.card {
  background: var(--color-surface);
  border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  border-radius: $border-radius-lg;
  box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
  transition: all var(--transition-medium);

  &:hover {
    transform: translateY(-2px);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);
  }
}
```

### Container System
```scss
.container {
  max-width: 1280px;
  margin: 0 auto;
  padding: 0 var(--spacing-lg);

  @media (min-width: $breakpoint-md) {
    padding: 0 var(--spacing-xl);
  }
}
```

### Layout System
```scss
.app-layout {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  min-height: 100vh;
}

.content {
  flex: 1;
  box-sizing: border-box;
  padding: var(--spacing-6xl); // Large section padding
}
```

## 9. FORM ELEMENTS

### Input Styling
```scss
input, select, textarea {
  font-family: $font-primary;
  font-size: $font-size-md;
  color: var(--color-text);
  border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  border-radius: $border-radius-md;
  transition: all var(--transition-fast);

  &::placeholder {
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
  }

  &:focus {
    outline: 2px solid var(--color-accent);
    outline-offset: 2px;
    border-color: var(--color-accent);
  }
}

// Remove default appearance
input[type="date"],
input[type="time"],
select {
  appearance: none;
  -webkit-appearance: none;
}
```

## 10. ACCESSIBILITY

### Screen Reader Only
```scss
.visually-hidden {
  position: absolute !important;
  width: 1px !important;
  height: 1px !important;
  padding: 0 !important;
  margin: -1px !important;
  overflow: hidden !important;
  clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0) !important;
  white-space: nowrap !important;
  border: 0 !important;
}
```

## 11. RESPONSIVE BREAKPOINTS

```scss
$breakpoint-sm: 640px;
$breakpoint-md: 768px;
$breakpoint-lg: 1024px;
$breakpoint-xl: 1280px;
```

## 12. TYPOGRAPHY

### Font System
```scss
$font-primary: "Quicksand", sans-serif;

$font-size-2xs: 0.625rem;
$font-size-xs: 0.75rem;
$font-size-sm: 0.875rem;
$font-size-md: 1rem;
$font-size-lg: 1.125rem;
$font-size-xl: 1.25rem;
$font-size-2xl: 1.5rem;
$font-size-3xl: 1.875rem;
```

### Body Text
```scss
body {
  font-family: $font-primary;
  font-size: $font-size-md;
  font-weight: 400;
  line-height: 1.5;
  color: var(--color-text);
  background: var(--color-bg);
  -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
}
```

## 13. COMPONENT-SPECIFIC VARIABLES

### Header/Navigation
```scss
--header-bg: light/dark variants
--header-text: light/dark variants
--header-link-text: light/dark variants
--header-link-hover: light/dark variants
```

### Dropdown/Menu
```scss
--dropdown-bg: light/dark variants
--dropdown-border: light/dark variants
--dropdown-text: light/dark variants
--dropdown-item-hover-bg: light/dark variants
```

## 14. ANIMATION PRINCIPLES

- Use `transform: translateY(-1px)` for button hovers
- Use `transform: translateY(-2px)` for card hovers
- Include `&:active { transform: translateY(0); }` for buttons
- Add box-shadow changes on hover for depth
- Use consistent transition timing (fast/medium)

## 15. DARK MODE CONSIDERATIONS

- Always provide dark variants for colors
- Use `[data-theme="dark"]` selector
- Increase shadow opacity in dark mode
- Use `--icon-theme-color: brightness(0) invert(1)` for icon theming
- Ensure sufficient contrast ratios
